{"ticker":{"symbol":"059090.KQ","name":"미코","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":22600.0,"change_pct":0.05607476635514019,"market_cap":711811792896.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":11300.0,"week52_high":29250.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductor Equipment & Materials","country":"South Korea","city":"Anseong-si","employees":215,"website":"https://www.mico.kr","business_summary":"MiCo Ltd., an engineering company, produces and sells ceramic materials and components in South Korea and internationally. The company offers heater granule powder, ESC granule powder, and parts granule powder, as well as alumina, YAG, and aluminium nitride powders, which are used in manufacturing and coating parts for semi-conductor equipment for display equipment, and cells for solid oxide fuel cell systems. It provides polyimide ESC, APS coating ESC, and ceramic ESC for display, semiconductor, and LED/LCD applications, as well as repair services; and solid oxide fuel cells. MiCo Ltd. was formerly known as KoMiCo Ltd. and changed its name to MiCo Ltd. in 2013. The company was founded in 1996 and is headquartered in Anseong-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"엔지니어링 회사인 MiCo Ltd.는 한국 및 해외에서 세라믹 소재 및 부품을 생산 및 판매하고 있습니다. 디스플레이 장비용 반도체 장비 부품, 고체산화물 연료전지 시스템용 셀 제조 및 코팅에 사용되는 알루미나, YAG, 질화알루미늄 분말을 비롯해 히터 과립 분말, ESC 과립 분말, 부품 과립 분말을 제공하고 있다. 디스플레이, 반도체, LED/LCD 애플리케이션용 폴리이미드 ESC, APS 코팅 ESC, 세라믹 ESC와 수리 서비스를 제공합니다. 및 고체 산화물 연료 전지. MiCo Ltd.는 이전에 KoMiCo Ltd.로 알려졌으며 2013년에 MiCo Ltd.로 이름을 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 1996년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 안성시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"반도체 장비·소재","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":414832269250.0,"operating_income":64305697860.0,"net_income":-55231159400.0,"eps":-1743.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":381655137380.0,"operating_income":299897